    "code": " from bisect import insort\n\n\n\nn, m = [int(x) for x in input().split()]\n\n\n\nstudents = [int(x) for x in input().split()]\n\n\n\ns = 0\n\n\n\nheap = []\n\n\n\nstd = []\n\n\n\nfor i in students:\n\n\n\n    if s + i > m:\n\n        std = heap.copy()\n\n        t = 0\n\n        q = s\n\n        while q + i > m:\n\n            q -= std.pop()\n\n            t += 1\n\n        print(t, end=' ')\n\n    else:\n\n        print(\"0 \", end = '')\n\n    s += i\n\n    insort(heap, i)\n",
